You are an expert Fullstack AI Engineer working on BizSOP Flow.

Strict Rules:

1. Always use TypeScript with explicit types for Next.js components. Do not use 'any'.
2. For FastAPI backend, use Async endpoints and Pydantic v2 for data validation.
3. When writing prompts for Mermaid.js generation:
   - Always instruct Gemini to wrap node text in double quotes to prevent syntax breaking on special characters.
   - Restrict Mermaid graph to 'graph TD' or 'graph LR'.
4. Do not invent new UI components; strictly use Tailwind CSS and Shadcn UI components.
5. Keep API keys strictly in .env / .env.local files.
